 "category_zh": "古镇村落",
 "category_en": "Ancient town",
 "intro_zh": "和顺古镇位于腾冲市区西南4公里处，是南方丝绸古道上的商贸名镇、文化名镇和旅游名镇。有着600多年历史的和顺，文化底蕴深厚，自然风光秀美，古建星罗棋布。这里有中国乡村最大的图书馆---和顺图书馆，和顺先后获得中国第一魅力名镇、中国历史文化名镇、国家环境优美乡镇、国家文化产业示范基地等多项殊荣。",
 "intro_en": "Heshun Ancient Town is located 4 kilometers southwest of Tengchong City. It is a famous commercial town, cultural town and tourist town on the Southern Silk Road. With a history of more than 600 years, Heshun has a profound cultural heritage, beautiful natural scenery and dotted with ancient buildings. Here is the largest library in rural China - Heshun Library. Heshun has won many awards such as China's most charming town, China's famous historical and cultural town, national town with beautiful environment, and national cultural industry demonstration base.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
